| 类别 | 待闭合内容 | 关闭方式 |
|---|---|---|
| Read Return | Ordered/Fixed-route或标准Correlation合同 | DFI/PHY ICD |
| Earliest Return | RD Issue至最早`dfi_rddata_valid`边界 | DFI/PHY ICD |
| Read Layout | 1:8 Phase与Logical Position映射 | DDR6/PHY |
| Read Capacity | Expected、Assembly、Ingress Depth | Traffic/FPGA评估 |
| Read Lane | 最大并发Return数量 | DFI/PHY |
| Read Protection | ECC/CRC/DBI/Metadata最终布局 | Product/DDR6 |
| No-old-return | Old DFI Return何时保证消失 | 第10章 + PHY ICD |
| Payload Capacity | WDATA Depth及RAM组织 | Host Traffic/FPGA |
| WDATA Lane | Host Capture及DFI输出带宽 | Host/DFI |
| Write Join | PI Join深度及Pipeline | RTL/P&R |
| Write Visibility | 不可取消/Device-visible边界 | DFI/PHY ICD |
